    { "label": "Homonyms", "detail": "Not Amr ibn Khalid al-Qurashi al-Kufi, resident of Wasit, discarded and accused of lying by Waki' (Taqrib 5021), nor Amr ibn Khalid Abu Hafs al-A'sha (Taqrib 5022)." }
